@startuml wifi_recovery
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor #121b28
 BorderColor #64b5f6
 FontColor #e6edf7
 StartColor #74d9ae
 EndColor #74d9ae
}
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #121b28
 BorderColor #64b5f6
 FontColor #e6edf7
 DiamondBackgroundColor #24314a
 DiamondBorderColor #c5a1ff
 DiamondFontColor #e6edf7
 StartColor #74d9ae
 EndColor #74d9ae
}
title Link-loss recovery
start
:Link lost;
:Defer active Wi-Fi work until Idle;
:Reconnect; 4 attempts;\n5 s between failures;
if (IP ready?) then (yes)
 :CONNECTED;
else (no)
 :ERROR; start setup automatically;\nScan/cache -> open AP -> portal;
endif
stop
legend bottom
 Listening interrupts recovery. Resume only in Idle.
 Wi-Fi-only errors do not mute audio or gate automatic recovery on acknowledgement.
endlegend
/'
Shared workflow contract:
Entry: setup at boot or Idle. Initial scan/cache -> open AP -> serve portal. Rescans retain AP/server. A 2 s hold in Idle re-enters after exit.
Retry: boot/reconnect/scan 4 attempts total, 5 s between failures; portal join 1; save 2; AP start manual. Reset each operation budget.
Recovery: boot/AP/exhausted scan -> manual 2 s hold; reconnect exhaustion -> automatic setup in Idle; portal join failure -> show error then rescan/selection; save failure -> connected with unsaved credentials, old valid record preserved.
Global setup failure: software error that prevents continuing -> ERROR, log/show cause, release setup resources, offline. A later 2 s hold can retry.
Portal: open hotspot; QR portal URL after manual hotspot join; manual phone rejoin accepted. One document, password only for protected selection. Queue Connect; browser polls; confirm selected network and assigned address, not an old link. Publish cache only after scan-finished.
Cancel/timer: form Back returns to selection. Setup Cancel closes setup. User cancel is locked from Connect submission through save/automatic closure. Timeout is 5 min inactivity; selection/password input/Rescan reset it; polling does not. Pause during actions.
Closure: success or save warning 10 s, then AP/server off, station retained. Cancel/timeout notice before shutdown, no extra delay. Keep established station; otherwise stop attempts and release Wi-Fi services. Final nodes return to controller, not device shutdown.
Global listening interrupt: stop setup/reconnect work before audio starts; keep established station. Serialize join completion vs teardown, reject late callbacks, finish atomic settings writes safely. Defer reconnection until Idle.
Feedback: newest status/error catalogue applies. Violet: steady portal, breathing scan/join/reconnect, 3 quick flashes on connection. Red counted code at 2 Hz: Wi-Fi save=2, scan=3, boot join=4, reconnect=5, AP start=6. Serial log carries cause. Short press clears indication only; recovery/2 s setup hold does not require acknowledgement.
Wi-Fi-only failures preserve functioning audio, allow offline Start and retain selected recovery paths. Other faults use the catalogue halt/clear rules. Generic settings failure is not Wi-Fi credential-save failure.
Time/secure server transport/registration belong to later FHIR, not Wi-Fi setup completion. Hardware timing and radio/audio interference are not verified.
'/
@enduml
